# x86 Backend v3 Final Audit — post-9-fixes, post-oodac.new build

Logline: One-shot read-only audit of the x86 backend as of 2026-08-26 after the 9 fixes of this turn and the oodac.new build (3.5MB), confirming file-shape, gate wiring, arm count, and per-fix evidence; superseded audits are x86_emit_post_fixes_final.oot and x86-final.oot.

Setup: Sources are openOODA/STATUS_v3.oot (in-flight floor snapshot), openOODA/audit/x86-post-fixes-summary.oot (96 lines, v2 consolidated table), openOODA/audit/x86_emit_post_fixes_final.oot (55 lines, prior post-fix final), ooda/oodac/x86_emit.oo (209 lines, dispatch), and the 28 sibling import targets under ooda/oodac/. No compiler run. No .oo file modified. No /tmp write. oodac.new was built once on 2026-08-26 and is the 3.5MB artifact that this audit takes as input.

Beats:
  1. Tabulate the 9 fixes with file:line evidence and source citation.
  2. List the remaining issues, ordered by severity.
  3. State the final verdict with one line of reasoning.
  4. Name the next 3 actions.

residual: A 6,936-fixture re-run against oodac.new to convert central estimates into measured numbers (STATUS_v3.oot:23, x86-post-fixes-summary.oot §4).

File: openOODA/audit/x86-backend-v3.oot
Status: smoke — read-only v3 final audit, 2026-08-26
Scope: x86 backend only; AArch64 lives in aarch64-final-state.oot; SSA stays inside this scope
Supersedes: x86_emit_post_fixes_final.oot (55 lines), x86-final.oot

